<Defs>
  <ThingDef ParentName="ResourceBase">
    <defName>PM_Solarite</defName>
    <label>Solarite</label>
    <description>A highly condensed, crystalline energy substance. The Star Devourer squad typically extracts it directly from the iron-based fusion reactor of their flagship, the "Aurora"—a reactor that achieves full mass-energy conversion by warping the Planck constant and the gravitational constant to force massive black holes into extreme Hawking radiation. Solarite is the primary energy source for most Purifier-aligned Protoss machinery. Fundamentally it is simply crystallized energy with no special tech lock: it can be produced from any high-energy device (ZPE, cold fusion, antimatter reactors, etc.), and even ordinary fusion events can crudely trigger a small emergency yield.</description>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Things/Resource/Solarite</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_StackCount</graphicClass>
    </graphicData>
    <soundInteract>Metal_Drop</soundInteract>
    <soundDrop>Standard_Drop</soundDrop>
    <stackLimit>200</stackLimit>
    <healthAffectsPrice>false</healthAffectsPrice>
    <useHitPoints>false</useHitPoints>
    <statBases>
      <MarketValue>40</MarketValue>
      <Mass>1.0</Mass>
      <Flammability>0</Flammability>
    </statBases>
    <intricate>true</intricate>
    <thingCategories>
      <li>Manufactured</li>
    </thingCategories>
    <tradeTags>
      <li>ExoticMisc</li>
    </tradeTags>
    <allowedArchonexusCount>200</allowedArchonexusCount>
  </ThingDef>

  <ThingDef ParentName="ResourceBase">
    <defName>PM_Adanium</defName>
    <label>Adanium</label>
    <description>Adanium shares its name with the adamantium alloy of Project Purifier. The Star Devourers make extensive use of these lattice metamaterials, with their immense mass-energy content, in their war machines and deep-space warships. Adanium redirects incoming attacks to divert their force, making it nearly indestructible against anything other than disintegration weaponry.</description>
